    "en": {
      "trackName": "Sokoban (Boxman) Watch",
      "description": "Sokoban (Boxman) Watch is an implementation of the classic box-pushing puzzle game for the Apple Watch. Each level has the same objective; to push boxes to their destination locations. Although this may sound simple, the progressive difficulty of the levels will certainly demand creativity, imagination and perseverance.\n\nThe rules are simple. You can only walk or push. You cannot walk through walls or over boxes and you cannot pull. There are 528 to play levels. Enjoy!\n\n\nFeatures\n\n* Player can choose between point and click mechanics, or d-pad controls\n* Intuitive controls to undo, move, and push boxes\n* Ability to save and load your path history\n* Access to the solution to each level\n* 2 boxes 88 levels + 3 boxes 88 levels + 4 boxes 88 levels + 5 boxes 88 levels",
      "releaseNotes": "Support Xcode 16",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/sokoban-boxman-watch/id1549386609?uo=4",
